OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Manchester leader defends deals
OL,4,Awith Man City owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former leader of Manchester City
OL,7,FCouncil has defended the council's
OL,8,Frelationship with the owners of
OL,9,FManchester City amid questions over
OL,10,Fland deals.
OL,12,FSir Richard Leese, who was head of the
OL,13,Fcouncil for 25 years until 2021 and is
OL,14,Falso honorary president of the club,
OL,15,Fsaid a decade-old deal with Abu Dhabi
OL,16,FUnited Group (ADUG) was "good for the
OL,17,Fcity".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
