OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Manchester leader defends deals
OL,4,Awith Man City owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe partnership between the authority
OL,7,Fand the company owned by Sheik Mansour
OL,8,Fbin zayed Al Nahyan has come under
OL,9,Frenewed scrutiny since City was found
OL,10,Fguilty of breaching Premier League
OL,11,Ffinancial regulations with "sham"
OL,12,Fcommercial contracts.
OL,14,FThe club has denied any wrongdoing is
OL,15,Fappealing against the charges.
